      "title": "Air pollutant emissions",
      "description": "Air pollutant emissions reported for OECD countries, where data is available, measured in tonnes per year.\n\nIndexed figures relate to changes since the year 1990 (1990 is assumed equal to 100). A figure lower than 100 indicates a reduction in emissions (e.g. 40 indicates a 60% reduction since 1990). Indexed figures are only available for countries with data extending to 1990.",
